Hello Chris,

No big deal.

1. In S-PLUS, left button click on the graphic you want to copy and
then enter Control-C.

2.  In WORD, left button click on the destination location and then
enter Control-V.  Next, right button click on the graph in WORD to
obtain a drop-down menu of tools you can use to modify the 
size and location of the graph.  Use of the tools is somewhat
tricky and requires practice.

