I am the programming beginner. 
I am using S-PLUS 4.5 to generate graphs from simulated data. 
Below are my algorithm, I tried to save the results and generate
graphs out of these codes...but I didn't succeed....
I would appreciate it very much if any of you can help me here...:-)

function(t0, n0, i, cutoff)
{
        repeat {
                u1 <-  - log(runif(1))
                v1 <- ifelse(runif(1) >= 0.5, 1, 0)
                t0 <- t0 + u1/n0
                n0 <- n0 + 2 * v1 - 1
                if(n0 == 0)
                        break
                if(t0 > cutoff)
                        break
                i <- i + 1
                cat(t0, n0, "\n")
        }
}

